  triage:triagedAt "2026-09-12T03:23:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:deferredNote "fenix's cleanup ruling (ATM 2026-09-12T04:44:29Z) adds worktree layer 5, fix/phase-ba-cleanup (new gh-stack layer above docs/ba6, cipher single writer); this tick-order fix moves off feature/ba3-nudge-invariant onto the consolidated cleanup layer per the O(n^2) fix-multiplication avoidance rule." ;
  triage:deferredNote "fenix (ATM 01M2A4DWXYME20KRNTBXHQS534, 2026-09-12T06:21:13Z): NON-BLOCKING ruling -- quality-mgr confirmed dispose() reads nothing a same-tick start mutates. Remediation = one-line doc note at docs/plans/phase-ba/sprint-BA.3-nudge-invariant.md:190 (doc-only). Deferred to post-landing review-findings stack, alongside RBQA-F001, TOML-001, SIZE-001; promoteTo unset." ;
